{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"GEN","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"创世记","commonName":"创世记","title":"创世记","order":1,"numberOfChapters":50,"sha256":"10a45bcf2ede9deb41605171c53170d502fcae5c3b35e4565dec7e08e91d0387","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/GEN/1.json","lastChapterNumber":50,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/GEN/50.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1531},"chapter":{"number":16,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["夏甲与以实玛利"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["亚伯兰的妻子撒莱没有给他生孩子。撒莱有个婢女名叫夏甲，是埃及人。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["撒莱对亚伯兰说：“耶和华不让我生育，请你与我的婢女同房，也许我可以借着她得子立后。”亚伯兰同意了撒莱的话。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["于是，撒莱把埃及婢女夏甲给亚伯兰做妾。那时亚伯兰已经在迦南住了十年。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["亚伯兰与夏甲同房，她就怀了孕。夏甲知道自己怀了孕，就轻视女主人撒莱。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["撒莱对亚伯兰说：“我受气都是因为你。我把婢女放在你怀里，她仗着自己怀了孕就轻视我，愿耶和华在你我之间主持公道。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["亚伯兰对撒莱说：“婢女在你手中，随你处置。”于是，撒莱苦待夏甲，夏甲就逃走了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["耶和华的天使在旷野中，通往书珥之路的水泉旁找到了夏甲，"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["便问她：“撒莱的婢女夏甲，你从哪里来？要到哪里去？”她回答说：“我是从女主人撒莱那里逃出来的。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["耶和华的天使对她说：“你要回到女主人那里顺服她。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["又说：“我必使你的后裔多得不可胜数。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["接着又说：“你现在怀了孕，将来会生一个男孩，你要给他取名叫以实玛利",{"noteId":12},"，因为耶和华已经听见你痛苦的哀声。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["这孩子性情必像野驴，他要跟人作对，人也要跟他作对。他必与他所有的弟兄为敌。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["夏甲称对她说话的耶和华为“看顾人的上帝”，她说：“我竟然在这里看见了那位看顾我的。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["因此，那口井被称为庇耳·拉海·莱",{"noteId":13},"，位于加低斯和巴列之间。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["后来夏甲为亚伯兰生了一个儿子，亚伯兰给他取名叫以实玛利。"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["夏甲生以实玛利时，亚伯兰八十六岁。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":12,"caller":"+","text":"“以实玛利”意思是“上帝听见了”。","reference":{"chapter":16,"verse":11}},{"noteId":13,"caller":"+","text":"“庇耳·拉海·莱”意思是“看顾我的永恒上帝之井”。","reference":{"chapter":16,"verse":14}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/GEN/16.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/GEN/17.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/GEN/15.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":16}